# VoIP 和通信系统特定规则

## SIP 和拨号计划

### 拨号计划开发

XML 拨号计划位于 `/app/dialplans/`，使用条件判断和正则表达式：

```xml
<extension name="local_extension">
    <condition field="destination_number" expression="^(\d{4})$">
        <action application="set" data="dialed_extension=$1"/>
        <action application="export" data="dialed_extension=$1"/>
        <action application="bridge" data="user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}"/>
    </condition>
</extension>
```

### 多租户拨号计划

考虑多租户场景（domain_uuid 隔离）：

```xml
<extension name="outbound" continue="true">
    <condition field="${domain_uuid}" expression="^${domain_uuid}$">
        <condition field="destination_number" expression="^(\d{10,11})$">
            <action application="set" data="effective_caller_id_number=${outbound_caller_id_number}"/>
            <action application="set" data="effective_caller_id_name=${outbound_caller_id_name}"/>
            <action application="bridge" data="sofia/gateway/${gateway_name}/$1"/>
        </condition>
    </condition>
</extension>
```

## FreeSWITCH 集成

### Event Socket Layer (ESL) 通信

```php
// 连接到 FreeSWITCH
$fp = fsockopen($switch_host, $switch_port, $errno, $errstr, 10);

if (!$fp) {
    // 连接失败处理
    message::add("无法连接到 FreeSWITCH: $errstr ($errno)", 'negative');
    return;
}

// 发送命令
fwrite($fp, "api originate user/1001 &echo\n\n");

// 读取响应
$response = fgets($fp, 1024);

// 关闭连接
fclose($fp);
```

### 通过 switch.php 执行 FreeSWITCH 命令

```php
// 执行 FreeSWITCH API 命令
$cmd = "originate user/1001 &echo";
$response = switch_command($cmd);

// 检查响应
if ($response !== "+OK") {
    message::add("命令执行失败: $response", 'negative');
    return;
}
```

