## 设备配置

### 设备模板

模板位于 `/resources/templates/`，支持多品牌设备：

```php
// 获取设备模板
$template_path = $_SERVER['DOCUMENT_ROOT'] . '/resources/templates/yealink/';

// 读取模板文件
$template_content = file_get_contents($template_path . 'template.cfg');

// 替换变量
$variables = array(
    '{mac_address}' => $mac_address,
    '{extension}' => $extension,
    '{display_name}' => $display_name,
    '{server_address}' => $_SESSION['domain_name']
);

foreach ($variables as $key => $value) {
    $template_content = str_replace($key, $value, $template_content);
}

// 输出配置文件
header('Content-Type: application/octet-stream');
header('Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="' . $mac_address . '.cfg"');
echo $template_content;
```

### 多品牌设备支持

```php
// 根据设备品牌选择模板
switch ($device_vendor) {
    case 'yealink':
        $template_path = $_SERVER['DOCUMENT_ROOT'] . '/resources/templates/yealink/';
        break;
    case 'grandstream':
        $template_path = $_SERVER['DOCUMENT_ROOT'] . '/resources/templates/grandstream/';
        break;
    case 'cisco':
        $template_path = $_SERVER['DOCUMENT_ROOT'] . '/resources/templates/cisco/';
        break;
    default:
        message::add("不支持的设备品牌: $device_vendor", 'negative');
        return;
}
```

## 实时通信

### WebSocket 通信

```javascript
// 连接到 WebSocket
var protocol = window.location.protocol === 'https:' ? 'wss:' : 'ws:'
var wsUrl = protocol + '//' + window.location.host + '/ws'
var ws = new WebSocket(wsUrl)

ws.onopen = function (event) {
  console.log('WebSocket 连接已建立')
}

ws.onmessage = function (event) {
  var data = JSON.parse(event.data)

  switch (data.type) {
    case 'call_event':
      handleCallEvent(data)
      break
    case 'registration_event':
      handleRegistrationEvent(data)
      break
    default:
      console.log('未知事件类型:', data.type)
  }
}

function handleCallEvent(data) {
  // 处理通话事件
  if (data.event_subtype === 'CHANNEL_CREATE') {
    // 新通话创建
    addCallToPanel(data)
  } else if (data.event_subtype === 'CHANNEL_DESTROY') {
    // 通话结束
    removeCallFromPanel(data)
  }
}
```

### WebRTC 集成

```javascript
// 创建 WebRTC 连接
var pc = new RTCPeerConnection({
  iceServers: [{ urls: 'stun.qq.com' }, { urls: 'miwifi.com' }],
})

// 处理 ICE 候选
pc.onicecandidate = function (event) {
  if (event.candidate) {
    // 发送 ICE 候选到服务器
    sendIceCandidate(event.candidate)
  }
}

// 处理远程流
pc.ontrack = function (event) {
  var remoteVideo = document.getElementById('remote-video')
  remoteVideo.srcObject = event.streams[0]
}

// 创建 offer
pc.createOffer()
  .then(function (offer) {
    return pc.setLocalDescription(offer)
  })
  .then(function () {
    // 发送 offer 到服务器
    sendOffer(pc.localDescription)
  })
  .catch(function (error) {
    console.error('创建 offer 失败:', error)
  })
```

## 通话控制

### 发起通话

```php
// 发起通话
function originate_call($extension, $destination) {
    $cmd = "originate user/" . $extension . " &bridge(user/" . $destination . ")";
    $response = switch_command($cmd);

    if ($response !== "+OK") {
        message::add("发起通话失败: $response", 'negative');
        return false;
    }

    return true;
}
```

