## 语音邮件

### 语音邮件设置

```php
// 设置语音邮件
function set_voicemail($extension, $voicemail_password, $voicemail_email) {
    $sql = "UPDATE v_voicemails SET ";
    $sql .= "voicemail_password = :voicemail_password, ";
    $sql .= "voicemail_email = :voicemail_email, ";
    $sql .= "voicemail_enabled = 'true', ";
    $sql .= "update_date = :update_date, ";
    $sql .= "update_user = :update_user ";
    $sql .= "WHERE domain_uuid = :domain_uuid AND voicemail_id = :voicemail_id";

    $parameters = array(
        'voicemail_password' => $voicemail_password,
        'voicemail_email' => $voicemail_email,
        'update_date' => 'now()',
        'update_user' => $_SESSION['user']['user_uuid'],
        'domain_uuid' => $_SESSION['domain_uuid'],
        'voicemail_id' => $extension
    );

    $database->execute($sql, $parameters);
}
```

