## 调试和监控

### FreeSWITCH 调试

```php
// 获取注册状态
function get_registration_status($extension) {
    $cmd = "sofia status profile internal reg " . $extension;
    $response = switch_command($cmd);

    // 解析响应
    if (strpos($response, 'Registered') !== false) {
        return 'registered';
    } else {
        return 'unregistered';
    }
}

// 获取网关状态
function get_gateway_status($gateway_name) {
    $cmd = "sofia status gateway " . $gateway_name;
    $response = switch_command($cmd);

    // 解析响应
    if (strpos($response, 'REGED') !== false) {
        return 'registered';
    } else {
        return 'unregistered';
    }
}
```

### 通话监控

```php
// 获取活动通话
function get_active_calls() {
    $sql = "SELECT * FROM v_channels WHERE domain_uuid = :domain_uuid";
    $parameters = array('domain_uuid' => $_SESSION['domain_uuid']);
    $channels = $database->select($sql, $parameters, 'all');

    $calls = array();
    foreach ($channels as $channel) {
        $calls[] = array(
            'uuid' => $channel['call_uuid'],
            'caller_id_number' => $channel['caller_id_number'],
            'destination_number' => $channel['destination_number'],
            'callstate' => $channel['callstate'],
            'created' => $channel['created']
        );
    }

    return $calls;
}
```
